# dev/ is OPT-IN. Everything here is ignored unless it is listed below, so
# drafts, scratch scripts and private notes stay on this machine by default.
#
# To track a file, add a `!` line for it below and commit it. A file that is
# already tracked stays tracked whatever this file says.

*
